{"id":"f7c67b5ebe0aba12","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_ScopedRow.md","title":"ScopedRow","display":"ScopedRow","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"ScopedRow","parameters":["z847","z848","z849"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"ScopedRow"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>z847</span><span>z848</span><span>z849</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：指标替换与规约。有序参数：<code>z847</code>、<code>z848</code>、<code>z849</code>。</p>\n<p>d 为外部变量槽位数；最近绑定的指标为零。：单行局部条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ ScopedRow z847 z848 z849)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists d\n  (exists t\n    (and\n      (@ Pair d t z849)\n      (and\n        (@ Nat d)\n        (and\n          (@ AnyRaw t)\n          (or\n            (exists z852 (and (@ TVar z852 t) (in z852 d)))\n            (or\n              (exists z852 (@ TConst z852 t))\n              (or\n                (exists z854\n                  (exists z857\n                    (and\n                      (@ ULam z854 t)\n                      (and\n                        (@ Succ d z857)\n                        (exists z858 (exists z859 (and (in z858 z848) (and (@ App z847 z858 z859) (@ Pair z857 z854 z859)))))))))\n                (or\n                  (exists z853\n                    (exists z854\n                      (exists z857\n                        (and\n                          (@ TLam z853 z854 t)\n                          (and\n                            (@ Succ d z857)\n                            (exists z860 (exists z861 (and (in z860 z848) (and (@ App z847 z860 z861) (@ Pair z857 z854 z861))))))))))\n                  (exists z855\n                    (exists z856\n                      (and\n                        (@ TApp z855 z856 t)\n                        (and\n                          (exists z862 (exists z863 (and (in z862 z848) (and (@ App z847 z862 z863) (@ Pair d z855 z863)))))\n                          (exists z864 (exists z865 (and (in z864 z848) (and (@ App z847 z864 z865) (@ Pair d z856 z865))))))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"487e9a7343d4d692\" href=\"?note=487e9a7343d4d692\" title=\"ZFC_AnyRaw\">AnyRaw</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e2136a636857d477\" href=\"?note=e2136a636857d477\" title=\"ZFC_Nat\">Nat</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0a7fe33bb2e95221\" href=\"?note=0a7fe33bb2e95221\" title=\"ZFC_Pair\">Pair</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1d9ce9ba5108a31b\" href=\"?note=1d9ce9ba5108a31b\" title=\"ZFC_Succ\">Succ</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8ee8586c4703b19e\" href=\"?note=8ee8586c4703b19e\" title=\"ZFC_TApp\">TApp</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"ce774aac70609584\" href=\"?note=ce774aac70609584\" title=\"ZFC_TConst\">TConst</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"59c4a3ef7b6eaded\" href=\"?note=59c4a3ef7b6eaded\" title=\"ZFC_TLam\">TLam</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"00213bb93d499434\" href=\"?note=00213bb93d499434\" title=\"ZFC_TVar\">TVar</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"f077e9016ad9f66b\" href=\"?note=f077e9016ad9f66b\" title=\"ZFC_ULam\">ULam</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ ScopedRow z847 z848 z849)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_AnyRaw","status":"resolved","id":"487e9a7343d4d692","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_AnyRaw|AnyRaw]]；[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_Succ|Succ]]；[[ZFC_TApp|TApp]]；[[ZFC_TConst|TConst]]；[[ZFC_TLam|TLam]]；[[ZFC_TVar|TVar]]；[[ZFC_ULam|ULam]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_App","status":"resolved","id":"8bd25e131370b9c4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_AnyRaw|AnyRaw]]；[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_Succ|Succ]]；[[ZFC_TApp|TApp]]；[[ZFC_TConst|TConst]]；[[ZFC_TLam|TLam]]；[[ZFC_TVar|TVar]]；[[ZFC_ULam|ULam]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Nat","status":"resolved","id":"e2136a636857d477","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_AnyRaw|AnyRaw]]；[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_Succ|Succ]]；[[ZFC_TApp|TApp]]；[[ZFC_TConst|TConst]]；[[ZFC_TLam|TLam]]；[[ZFC_TVar|TVar]]；[[ZFC_ULam|ULam]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Pair","status":"resolved","id":"0a7fe33bb2e95221","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_AnyRaw|AnyRaw]]；[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_Succ|Succ]]；[[ZFC_TApp|TApp]]；[[ZFC_TConst|TConst]]；[[ZFC_TLam|TLam]]；[[ZFC_TVar|TVar]]；[[ZFC_ULam|ULam]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Succ","status":"resolved","id":"1d9ce9ba5108a31b","anchor":"ref-6","targe